[
  {
    "id": "icmpv6_smoke_01",
    "proto": "icmpv6",
    "summary": "冒烟：ICMPv6 Echo Request → 自动 Reply（IPv6 链路，地址住 ip 层）。type 128/129、code 0、id/seq 固定 1，共 2 包",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "2001:db8::1",
            "dst": "2001:db8::2"
          }
        },
        {
          "icmpv6": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 2,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "icmpv6.type",
          "value": "128"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "icmpv6.code",
          "value": "0"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "icmpv6.echo.identifier",
          "value": "0x0001"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "icmpv6.echo.sequence_number",
          "value": "1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ipv6.src",
          "value": "2001:db8::1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ipv6.dst",
          "value": "2001:db8::2"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ipv6.hlim",
          "value": "64"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "icmpv6.type",
          "value": "129"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "icmpv6.code",
          "value": "0"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "icmpv6.echo.identifier",
          "value": "0x0001"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "icmpv6.echo.sequence_number",
          "value": "1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "ipv6.src",
          "value": "2001:db8::2"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "ipv6.dst",
          "value": "2001:db8::1"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "RFC 4443 §4.1：type 128=Echo Request、129=Echo Reply，code=0；identifier/sequence 回显不变",
        "D-ICMPV6-1 P5 改写：src_ip/dst_ip→layers[ip].src/dst、icmpv6:{}→层内空 map（空层=缺省 ping：type 128/code 0/seq 1/data ping，决策 D1 镜像 parse）；fields 断言全部保留，预期字节一致",
        "自动回复（auto-reply）：应答交换 src/dst，id/seq 复刻请求值",
        "tshark 探针实测：全部值与上表一致，校验和状态 good（1）"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "icmpv6_vn_presence",
    "proto": "icmpv6",
    "summary": "T-ICMPV6-2: 顶层 icmpv6 presence 判死（空 map 也死，CheckProtoFlat sv 先例）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "2001:db8::1",
            "dst": "2001:db8::2"
          }
        },
        {
          "icmpv6": {}
        }
      ],
      "icmpv6": {}
    },
    "expect": {
      "expect_error": true,
      "error_contains": "top-level icmpv6 sub-config",
      "notes": [
        "D-ICMPV6-1 §2 presence 门：层链形状下顶层 icmpv6 子映射出现即拒（create-time，无落盘）",
        "failing 先行红例①同源；spec_json 内顶层 icmpv6 键即触发门"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "icmpv6_vn_static_copy",
    "proto": "icmpv6",
    "summary": "T-ICMPV6-3: ip 层显式标量 v6 地址 + flows=2 拒绝（static four-tuple 门）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "2001:db8::1",
            "dst": "2001:db8::2"
          }
        },
        {
          "icmpv6": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "expect_error": true,
      "error_contains": "static four-tuple"
    },
    "strategy_fc": {
      "type": "flows",
      "value": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "icmpv6_neg_v4",
    "proto": "icmpv6",
    "summary": "T-ICMPV6-4: v4 地址经 [ip,icmpv6] 链必须拒（legacy Validate v6 强制 icmpv6.go:60-79 复用）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "10.0.0.2"
          }
        },
        {
          "icmpv6": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "expect_error": true,
      "error_contains": "must be IPv6",
      "notes": [
        "依赖链②：实现前链上无 validator=v4 静默放行（红例④）；复用 legacy 检查零新文案"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "icmpv6_neg_type",
    "proto": "icmpv6",
    "summary": "T-ICMPV6-5: type=130 非法（Echo 语义仅 128/129）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "2001:db8::1",
            "dst": "2001:db8::2"
          }
        },
        {
          "icmpv6": {
            "type": 130
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "expect_error": true,
      "error_contains": "icmpv6 type must be 128 (Echo Request) or 129 (Echo Reply), got 130",
      "notes": [
        "D-ICMPV6-1 §5 validator 新分支（legacy 路径不查 type，链路径补齐）"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "icmpv6_neg_code",
    "proto": "icmpv6",
    "summary": "T-ICMPV6-6: code=1 非 0（Echo 报文 code 恒 0，RFC 4443 §4.1/§4.2）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "2001:db8::1",
            "dst": "2001:db8::2"
          }
        },
        {
          "icmpv6": {
            "code": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "expect_error": true,
      "error_contains": "icmpv6 code must be 0 for Echo, got 1",
      "notes": [
        "D-ICMPV6-1 §5 validator 新分支"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "icmpv6_neg_pattern_step",
    "proto": "icmpv6",
    "summary": "T-ICMPV6-7: pattern step type=0 非法",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "2001:db8::1",
            "dst": "2001:db8::2"
          }
        },
        {
          "icmpv6": {
            "pattern": [
              {
                "type": 0,
                "sequence": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "expect_error": true,
      "error_contains": "icmpv6 pattern step 1 type must be 128 or 129, got 0",
      "notes": [
        "D-ICMPV6-1 §5 validator 逐步校验；step 缺省 type=128 由 translate 镜像 parse（红例⑤），显式 0 必拒"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "icmpv6_type_129",
    "proto": "icmpv6",
    "summary": "T-ICMPV6-8: type=129 单发（无 auto-reply，up 向 1 包）；identifier/sequence/data 显式（id=7≠seq=9 证非回退）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "2001:db8::1",
            "dst": "2001:db8::2"
          }
        },
        {
          "icmpv6": {
            "type": 129,
            "identifier": 7,
            "sequence": 9,
            "data": "probe"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 1,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "icmpv6.type",
          "value": "129"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "icmpv6.code",
          "value": "0"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "icmpv6.echo.identifier",
          "value": "0x0007"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "icmpv6.echo.sequence_number",
          "value": "9"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ipv6.src",
          "value": "2001:db8::1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ipv6.dst",
          "value": "2001:db8::2"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "data.data",
          "value": "70726f6265"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "legacy 单 ping 路径：仅 type=128 才自动回包（icmpv6.go:203-226）；129 单发源/目的不换向",
        "identifier 显式 7、sequence 显式 9：回显字段逐字节钉死（id=0x0007≠seq=9，证明非 0 回退路径）；data 显式 probe（9.21 枚举：identifier 显式格由此例承担）"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "icmpv6_pattern_mixed",
    "proto": "icmpv6",
    "summary": "T-ICMPV6-9: Pattern 混型步（128 步+129 步）→ 3 包（req+reply 对 + 单 reply）；identifier 缺省 0 回退 Sequence",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "2001:db8::1",
            "dst": "2001:db8::2"
          }
        },
        {
          "icmpv6": {
            "pattern": [
              {
                "type": 128,
                "sequence": 1
              },
              {
                "type": 129,
                "sequence": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 3,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "icmpv6.type",
          "value": "128"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "icmpv6.echo.sequence_number",
          "value": "1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "icmpv6.echo.identifier",
          "value": "0x0001"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "icmpv6.type",
          "value": "129"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "icmpv6.echo.sequence_number",
          "value": "1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "icmpv6.echo.identifier",
          "value": "0x0001"
        },
        {
          "packet": 3,
          "field": "icmpv6.type",
          "value": "129"
        },
        {
          "packet": 3,
          "field": "icmpv6.echo.sequence_number",
          "value": "2"
        },
        {
          "packet": 3,
          "field": "icmpv6.echo.identifier",
          "value": "0x0002"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "legacy pattern 路径：每步 1 包，type=128 步追加自动回包（icmpv6.go:160-191）→ 128/129/129",
        "identifier 缺省 0 → 回退 Sequence（icmpv6.go:288-291，ICMPv4 同款），步2 seq=2 → id=2"
      ]
    }
  },
