  {
    "id": "icmpv6_ip_dyn_multi",
    "proto": "icmpv6",
    "summary": "T-ICMPV6-11: ip.src 动态 inc + flows=2 → 4 包逐流源异（3.14 逃生口；dynamic 对象豁免 static copy 门）",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": {
              "strategy": "inc",
              "range": [
                "2001:db8::1",
                "2001:db8::2"
              ],
              "step": 1
            },
            "dst": "2001:db8::9"
          }
        },
        {
          "icmpv6": {}
        }
      ],
      "group_id": {
        "strategy": "fixed",
        "value": "icmpv6-dyn-multi"
      }
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 4,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ipv6.src",
          "value": "2001:db8::1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "ipv6.src",
          "value": "2001:db8::9"
        },
        {
          "packet": 3,
          "field": "ipv6.src",
          "value": "2001:db8::2"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "ipv6.src",
          "value": "2001:db8::9"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "srv6_mf03 先例：group_id 固定 → 单 worker FIFO 确定序（分片路由否则流序不定）",
        "逐流成对序：flow1 req(::1)/reply(src=dst ::9)、flow2 req(::2)/reply(::9)；首跑 pcap 校准（9.31）",
        "v6 inc 解析=ResolveIPValue 框架既有；dynamic 对象豁免 static copy 门"
      ]
    },
    "strategy_fc": {
      "type": "flows",
      "value": 2
    }
  }
